---
import FigureHeading from '../FigureHeading.astro';
---

<figure class="automated-search-overview" aria-label="Configuration of the automated harness search across three SMDD task families">
  <FigureHeading
    label="FIG. 21"
    title="The meta-agent optimizes the harness, not the scientific agent"
    subtitle="Interaction Point Discovery · Lead Optimization · Scaffold Hopping"
  />

  <div class="search-card">
    <p class="protocol">The same search protocol was run independently for Interaction Point Discovery, Lead Optimization, and Scaffold Hopping.</p>

    <section class="band actors" aria-labelledby="search-actors-heading">
      <h2 id="search-actors-heading">Who is optimizing whom?</h2>
      <div class="actor-flow">
        <article>
          <span>Meta-agent</span>
          <strong>Claude Opus 5</strong>
          <p>redesigns the harness</p>
        </article>
        <div class="edit-arrow" aria-label="rewrites harness">
          <span>rewrites harness</span><i>→</i>
        </div>
        <article>
          <span>Fixed scientific agent</span>
          <strong>Qwen 3.5 9B</strong>
          <p>solves the SMDD tasks</p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="band evaluation" aria-labelledby="search-evaluation-heading">
      <h2 id="search-evaluation-heading">One harness evaluation</h2>
      <div class="equation" aria-label="20 tasks times 4 rollouts equals 80 trajectories">
        <div><strong>20</strong><span>tasks</span></div>
        <i>×</i>
        <div><strong>4</strong><span>rollouts</span></div>
        <i>=</i>
        <div class="result"><strong>80</strong><span>trajectories</span></div>
      </div>
      <p>Every candidate harness is tested on the same search set.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="band full-search" aria-labelledby="full-search-heading">
      <h2 id="full-search-heading">Full search</h2>
      <div class="search-math">
        <div class="iterations">
          <p><span>base harness</span><i>+</i><span>10 new iterations</span></p>
          <b aria-hidden="true">↓</b>
          <strong>11 harness evaluations</strong>
        </div>
        <div class="family-total">
          <p><b>11</b><i>×</i><b>80</b><i>=</i><strong>880</strong></p>
          <span>trajectories / task family</span>
        </div>
        <div class="grand-total">
          <small>3 task families</small>
          <strong>2,640</strong>
          <span>child-agent trajectories</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="method-chips">
        <details>
          <summary><span>objective</span><strong>terminal task success only</strong></summary>
          <p>A candidate harness receives reward only when the child agent solves the complete task. No partial-credit signals, task-specific rubrics, or intermediate rewards are provided.</p>
        </details>
        <details>
          <summary><span>search space</span><strong>full executable harness</strong></summary>
          <p>The meta-agent may modify prompts, tools, state representation, context handling, wrappers, control flow, and submission logic. <b>The scientific agent, tasks, and evaluator remain fixed.</b></p>
        </details>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
  <figcaption><strong>We keep the scientific agent fixed and search over the executable harness around it.</strong> Claude Opus 5 acts as the meta-agent, proposing harness revisions that are evaluated by running four independent Qwen 3.5 9B rollouts on each of 20 tasks. Each task family receives 11 harness evaluations, yielding 880 child-agent trajectories per family and 2,640 across the three experiments. The search objective is terminal task success only; no task-specific partial-credit reward is provided.</figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .automated-search-overview {
    --accent:#087c83;
    width:min(var(--wide-width), var(--breakout-max-width, calc(100vw - 2 * var(--page-gutter))));
    max-width:calc(100vw - 2 * var(--page-gutter));
    box-sizing:border-box;
    margin:var(--space-6) 0;
    margin-inline:50%;
    transform:translateX(-50%);
    color:var(--color-ink);
    font:14px/1.5 var(--font-sans);
  }
  .search-card { border:1px solid var(--color-line); background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--color-paper-raised) 70%,var(--color-paper)); }
  .protocol { padding:14px 22px; margin:0; border-bottom:1px solid var(--color-line); color:var(--color-ink-soft); font:13px/1.55 var(--font-sans); text-align:center; }
  .band { padding:21px 24px 23px; }
  .band + .band { border-top:1px solid var(--color-line); }
  .band > h2 { margin:0 0 17px; color:var(--color-ink-soft); font:600 11px/1.4 var(--font-mono); letter-spacing:.075em; text-align:center; text-transform:uppercase; }

  .actor-flow { display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 180px 1fr; align-items:center; gap:18px; max-width:840px; margin:0 auto; }
  .actor-flow article { min-width:0; text-align:center; }
  .actor-flow article > span { display:block; color:var(--accent); font:600 11px/1.35 var(--font-mono); letter-spacing:.06em; text-transform:uppercase; }
  .actor-flow article > strong { display:block; margin-top:4px; font:500 24px/1.25 var(--font-serif); }
  .actor-flow article > p { margin:4px 0 0; color:var(--color-ink-soft); font-size:13px; }
  .edit-arrow { display:flex; align-items:center; gap:9px; color:var(--accent); }
  .edit-arrow::before { flex:1; border-top:1px solid var(--accent); content:''; }
  .edit-arrow span { font:10px/1.3 var(--font-mono); white-space:nowrap; }
  .edit-arrow i { font:17px/1 var(--font-mono); font-style:normal; }

  .evaluation { text-align:center; }
  .equation { display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr auto 1fr auto 1fr; align-items:center; gap:22px; max-width:730px; margin:0 auto; }
  .equation > div { display:flex; align-items:baseline; justify-content:center; gap:9px; padding:10px 13px; border-top:1px solid var(--color-line); border-bottom:1px solid var(--color-line); }
  .equation strong { color:var(--accent); font:500 36px/1 var(--font-serif); }
  .equation span { color:var(--color-ink-soft); font:12px/1.3 var(--font-mono); text-transform:uppercase; }
  .equation > i { color:var(--accent); font:20px/1 var(--font-mono); font-style:normal; }
  .equation .result { background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--accent) 6%,transparent); }
  .equation .result strong { font-size:42px; }
  .evaluation > p { margin:12px 0 0; color:var(--color-ink-soft); font:12px/1.5 var(--font-mono); }

  .search-math { display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr 1.15fr; align-items:stretch; max-width:930px; margin:0 auto; }
  .search-math > div { display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; flex-direction:column; min-height:122px; padding:4px 24px; text-align:center; }
  .search-math > div + div { border-left:1px solid var(--color-line); }
  .iterations p, .family-total p { display:flex; align-items:baseline; justify-content:center; gap:8px; margin:0; }
  .iterations p span { font:600 12px/1.35 var(--font-mono); text-transform:uppercase; }
  .iterations p i, .family-total p i { color:var(--accent); font-style:normal; }
  .iterations > b { margin:6px 0 3px; color:var(--accent); font:15px/1 var(--font-mono); }
  .iterations > strong { font:500 18px/1.3 var(--font-serif); }
  .family-total p b { color:var(--color-ink-soft); font:500 24px/1 var(--font-serif); }
  .family-total p strong { color:var(--accent); font:500 31px/1 var(--font-serif); }
  .family-total > span { margin-top:7px; color:var(--color-ink-soft); font:11px/1.35 var(--font-mono); }
  .grand-total small { color:var(--color-ink-soft); font:11px/1.3 var(--font-mono); text-transform:uppercase; }
  .grand-total strong { margin-top:2px; color:var(--accent); font:500 54px/.95 var(--font-serif); }
  .grand-total span { margin-top:8px; font:600 12px/1.3 var(--font-mono); letter-spacing:.035em; text-transform:uppercase; }

  .method-chips { display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; gap:12px; max-width:800px; margin:24px auto 0; }
  details { border:1px solid var(--color-line); background:var(--color-paper); }
  summary { display:grid; grid-template-columns:90px 1fr auto; align-items:center; gap:12px; padding:11px 13px; cursor:pointer; list-style:none; }
  summary::-webkit-details-marker { display:none; }
  summary::after { color:var(--accent); font:15px/1 var(--font-mono); content:'+'; }
  details[open] summary::after { content:'−'; }
  summary:focus-visible { outline:2px solid var(--accent); outline-offset:2px; }
  summary span { color:var(--accent); font:600 10px/1.3 var(--font-mono); letter-spacing:.065em; text-transform:uppercase; }
  summary strong { font:600 12px/1.35 var(--font-sans); }
  details > p { padding:0 13px 12px 115px; margin:0; color:var(--color-ink-soft); font:12px/1.5 var(--font-sans); }
  details > p b { color:var(--color-ink); font-weight:600; }
  figcaption { margin:22px 0 0; color:var(--color-ink-soft); font:14px/1.8 var(--font-sans); }
  figcaption strong { color:var(--color-ink); font-weight:600; }

  @media (max-width:720px) {
    .actor-flow { grid-template-columns:1fr; gap:11px; }
    .actor-flow article, .actor-flow article:first-child { text-align:center; }
    .edit-arrow { justify-content:center; }
    .edit-arrow::before { display:none; }
    .edit-arrow i { transform:rotate(90deg); }
    .equation { gap:9px; }
    .equation > div { align-items:center; flex-direction:column; gap:4px; }
    .equation strong { font-size:30px; }
    .equation .result strong { font-size:36px; }
    .search-math { grid-template-columns:1fr; }
    .search-math > div { min-height:100px; padding:15px; }
    .search-math > div + div { border-top:1px solid var(--color-line); border-left:0; }
    .method-chips { grid-template-columns:1fr; }
  }
  @media (max-width:460px) {
    .protocol, .band { padding-right:14px; padding-left:14px; }
    .equation { grid-template-columns:1fr; }
    .equation > i { transform:rotate(90deg); }
    summary { grid-template-columns:75px 1fr auto; }
    details > p { padding-left:13px; }
  }
</style>
